      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Months are **masculine**: **un enero frío**, **el diciembre pasado**. Adjectives agree in the masculine."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "They're written in **lowercase**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Usually **no article**: **en mayo**, **hasta agosto**. Use **el / un** only with a description: **un marzo lluvioso**."
        },
